  "title": "Create Autofac container once per test run",
  "description": "Previously, `IContainer` instances were being build created multiple times per test run.  Given configuration is static, there's no reason to do this.  By moving `IContainer` to a singleton, large test suites will likely see a performance gain.\r\n\r\nAnecdotally, this new version made one test suite go from ~24 seconds to < 4.",
